
# Organization

- Main fields (in order): author, year, title, url; then the rest, in alphabetical order. url must always be the doi.org url, if available
- All field names in lowercase (and types too, when possible)
- All fields must have spaces before and after the equal sign, and must always use curly brackets
- All entry id's must be CamelCaseYYYY with the first author's main surname


